Subject: A sign-in method was added to your Steerpost account

--- text ---
Your Steerpost account is now connected to GitHub. You can use it to sign in.

You signed in with GitHub using the same email address, so we linked the two.

If this was not you, sign in with your password and change it, then tell your server admin. Review your account here: https://app.example.com/verify-email#token=abc123

Steerpost

